# Five workers send their id and yield; the recording is three clean round-robin
# passes, v=0..v=4 in order. That ordering is the VM's deterministic scheduler
# profile (CONCURRENCY.md F1-F3), not a promise `checkpoint()` makes, per the
# model owner's ruling of 2026-08-31.
#
# Measured on e34b7db8, native at SURGE_THREADS=8, five runs: fifteen sends
# arrived every time, and the order differed from the recording in all five.
# The multiset comparison still holds every worker to all three of its sends,
# so a starved or duplicated worker is still a failure here.
vm
